# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# editable-install build artifact
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never relax these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
token/
.env
.env.*
.hf_token
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Point clouds
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every cloud is large and regenerable: re-extract locally, or pull the mirror
# from Hugging Face (see the README's Stage 0). `data/` covers the whole tree,
# which is why there are no per-directory *.npy / *.parquet rules — they were
# redundant with this line and are gone.
data/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing under output/ goes to GitHub: data and results upload to
# Hugging Face. Scripts that produce published results must live in the
# repo tree, not under output/ (a lost script once made the E8 primary
# result unreproducible — 2026-08-03 review).
output/

# Keep new experiment notes and code, but not raw run files.
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
experiments/**/*.csv
experiments/**/*.tsv
experiments/**/raw/
experiments/**/artifacts/
experiments/**/checkpoints/
experiments/**/runs/
experiments/**/outputs/
experiments/**/results/
# Local library copies and judge run files (prompts, answers, logs).
experiments/**/.tf_overlay/
experiments/**/logs/
experiments/**/*.log
experiments/**/answers/
experiments/**/ranswers/
experiments/**/batches/
experiments/**/rbatches/
# Large scored data of the 2026-10-05 Q1 run; results*.json stay visible.
experiments/q1_emergence/261005_base_incontext_elicitation/KEY.json
experiments/q1_emergence/261005_base_incontext_elicitation/RKEY.json
experiments/q1_emergence/261005_base_incontext_elicitation/scored_rows.json
experiments/q1_emergence/261005_base_incontext_elicitation/role_scored_items.json

# Generated exploratory figures (large plotly HTML; regenerable, kept on disk).
# Note this pattern is one level deep by design: it catches
# exploratory/<stage>/figures/ and nothing further up.
exploratory/*/figures/

# Refactor verification scratch (large; sha.txt + dirnames stay tracked)
refactors/baselines/*/golden/
refactors/baselines/*/extra-reference/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes and selected workflow guidance
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
plans/
DESIGN.md
RESEARCH.md
